## Date and time handling

- Prefer **`DATE`**, **`DATETIME`**, **`TIMESTAMP`** types — not stringly-typed dates in new logic.
- Use **`EXTRACT(YEAR FROM col)`**, **`FORMAT_DATE`**, **`DATE_TRUNC`** for bucketing.
- Use **`DATE` literals:** `WHERE create_date >= DATE '2025-01-01'`.
- Be explicit about time zones when converting, e.g. **`TIMESTAMP(col, 'UTC')`**.

